---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us — Top Villa Luxury Homes"
  description="Top Villa Luxury Homes — a premium real estate development and advisory company delivering exceptional homes, land, and commercial properties across Nigeria."
>
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <span class="badge-soft mb-4">
        About Top Villa Luxury Homes
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold">Who We Are</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Top Villa Luxury Homes is a premium real estate development and advisory company committed to delivering exceptional homes, land, and commercial properties. We operate across the full real estate value chain — strategically acquiring prime land and properties, developing high-quality projects, and delivering seamless ownership solutions to our clients.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
        With a strong understanding of the Nigerian real estate market, we combine local expertise with global best practices to create properties that reflect luxury, functionality, and long-term value.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            To acquire and carefully select prime land and properties, develop high-quality homes and real estate projects, and deliver seamless ownership through secure, transparent, and professionally managed processes.
          </p>
          <p>
            We are committed to guiding individuals, families, and investors with integrity and expert support, providing real estate solutions they can trust, grow with, and invest in confidently for the long term.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden min-h-[350px]">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154084-4e5fe7c39198?w=800&q=80"
          alt="Top Villa Luxury Homes premium property"
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="p-8 rounded-xl surface-card text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4 text-primary">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary font-[family-name:var(--font-display)]">Prime Land</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-2">Strategic acquisition of premium land and properties in high-value locations across Nigeria.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 rounded-xl surface-card text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4 text-primary">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto"><path d="M12 22s-8-4.5-8-11.8A8 8 0 0 1 12 2a8 8 0 0 1 8 8.2c0 7.3-8 11.8-8 11.8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary font-[family-name:var(--font-display)]">Quality Homes</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-2">Developing high-quality residential and commercial projects with attention to every detail.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 rounded-xl surface-card text-center">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4 text-primary">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto"><path d="M12 22s-8-4.5-8-11.8A8 8 0 0 1 12 2a8 8 0 0 1 8 8.2c0 7.3-8 11.8-8 11.8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary font-[family-name:var(--font-display)]">Trusted Process</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-2">Seamless ownership through secure, transparent, and professionally managed transactions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 section-muted -mx-4 sm:-mx-6 lg:-mx-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold">Our Vision</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
          To be the most trusted name in Nigerian real estate — known for uncompromising quality, transparent dealings, and a relentless commitment to helping our clients build wealth and find homes they love.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Ready to work with us?</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mt-3">
        Whether you're buying your first home, looking for prime land, or seeking a trusted investment partner — we're here to help.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">
          Contact Us
        </a>
        <a href="/properties" class="btn-outline">
          Browse Properties
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
